Product packaging
-----------------
The same MIT codebase ships in three ways, analogous to Langfuse:

  1. Open Source (self-host) — you run the software; unlimited usage; community support.
  2. Vết Cloud — we host it for you (Hobby / Core / Pro / Enterprise).
  3. Self-hosted Enterprise — your infra, commercial support and compliance add-ons.

Information architecture for the tracing console (sidebar, traces table,
waterfall) follows the Langfuse MIT web app layout. No Langfuse source,
wordmark, or logo is included. Do not imply affiliation with Langfuse GmbH.
